                >Foundation + Evolution = Mission</span
              >
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-[#003087]/80 mb-8">
              We didn't just create transparent pricing—we perfected it over 8
              years, built a company with annual independent financial audits,
              and achieved a successful exit. Now we're enhancing that proven
              model with digital capabilities and market dynamics to serve
              millions.
